"OPEN\">[</mo><mtable columnspacing=\"1em\" rowspacing=\"4pt\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle mathcolor=\"red\"><mn>2</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle mathcolor=\"red\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">]</mo></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>\nThe resulting matrix is not orthogonal since, for example, the first column is not normalized.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is \"I, II, and III.\"</p>\n<div class=\"studentAnswerHeader\">Your Answer:</div><div class=\"studentAnswer\">I and III only</div></div>",
